From e7782416b020e49e22bc3f76de4206a1acb15b2a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: coldshalamov <93robingattis@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:49:05 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] perf(activity): gate classify signature prune on entity-index
 membership
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Quiet incremental classifyWorld walked signaturesById every tick (O(live
world)) just to prove liveness. After pinFacts-cache + closedFormMovers,
that walk is the remaining portable prune residual. Sanctioned
spawn/despawn already bumps entityIndex.version — skip the walk while it
is unchanged. Full classify still prunes against currentEntityIds.
Microbench ~178× on the quiet prune slice; activity-runtime 21/21.
